      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village grew around a sawmill built in 1857 by Enos P. Drake on the outlet of Mud Lake, a key early industry.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
